    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Ziņa, kas jau ir sasniegusi kāda cita serveri, tiek dzēsta, lūdzot serverim to izdzēst. Gandrīz visi no viņiem to dara; neviens no viņiem nevar tikt darīts.",
