    "The filter {title} is now applied" : "Filtrs {title} tagad ir lietots",
    "Could not create the filter" : "Nevarēja izveidot filtru",
    "Could not save the filter" : "Nevarēja saglabāt filtru",
    "The filter {title} is gone" : "Filtra {title} vairs nav",
    "Could not delete the filter" : "Nevarēja izdzēst filtru",
    "If a conversation seems to have a gap in it, this is why." : "Ja šķiet, ka sarunā ir plaisa, tas ir iemesls.",
    "Loading your filters …" : "Notiek filtru ielāde…",
    "You have no filters. A filter is a word or a phrase you would rather not read: a post carrying it is folded away behind the filter’s name, or taken out of your timelines altogether." : "Jums nav filtru. Filtrs ir vārds vai frāze, kuru jūs labprātāk nelasītu: ziņa ar to tiek nolocīta aiz filtra nosaukuma vai vispār izņemta no jūsu laika skalas.",
    "Expired" : "Beidzies derīguma termiņš",
    "{word} (whole word)" : "{word} (viss vārds)",
    "Edit the filter {title}" : "Rediģēt filtru {title}",
    "Edit" : "Rediģēt",
    "More actions for {title}" : "Citas darbības ar {title}",
    "Add a filter" : "Pievienojiet filtru",
    "Delete the filter {title}?" : "Vai dzēst filtru {title}?",
    "The filter goes and stops applying everywhere. Posts it was keeping from you are shown again — nothing was deleted, only hidden." : "Filtrs darbojas un pārstāj darboties visur. Ziņas, kuras tas neļāva jums slēpt, atkal tiek rādītas — nekas netika izdzēsts, tikai paslēpts.",
    "_%n filter is taking posts out of what you read._::_%n filters are taking posts out of what you read._" : ["%n filtrs izņem ziņas no jūsu lasītā.", "%n filtri izņem ziņas no jūsu lasītā.", "%n filtri izņem ziņas no jūsu lasītā."],
    "Your first post is out there. Welcome to the fediverse!" : "Jūsu pirmais ieraksts ir pieejams. Laipni lūgti fediversā!",
    "Somebody is reading you. You have your first follower!" : "Kāds tevi lasa. Tev ir pirmais sekotājs!",
    "A hundred posts. That is a body of work." : "Simts amatu. Tas ir darba kopums.",
    "One year here today. Thank you for sticking around." : "Šodien šeit ir viens gads. Paldies, ka palikāt blakus.",
    "Your address" : "Jūsu adrese",
    "People to follow" : "Cilvēki, kam sekot",
    "Bring your follows" : "Ņemiet līdzi savus sekotājus",
    "Ready" : "Gatavs",
    "Could not copy — select the address and copy it yourself" : "Nevarēja nokopēt — atlasiet adresi un kopējiet to pats",
    "Could not follow {account}" : "Nevarēja sekot {account}",
    "None of these accounts could be reached. Their servers may be busy — Discover has the pack, and says which ones." : "Nevarēja sasniegt nevienu no šiem kontiem. Viņu serveri var būt aizņemti — Discover ir komplekts un norāda, kuri no tiem.",
    "_Followed %n account_::_Followed %n accounts_" : ["Seko %n kontam", "Seko %n kontiem", "Seko %n kontiem"],
    "Could not follow these accounts" : "Nevarēja sekot šiem kontiem",
    "{followed} followed, {skipped} skipped, {failed} could not be reached" : "Sekoja {followed}, {skipped} izlaists, {failed} nevarēja sasniegt",
    "Could not import those follows" : "Nevarēja importēt tālāk norādītos",
    "Getting started on the fediverse" : "Darba sākšana fediversā",
    "Steps" : "Soļi",
    "Skip the introduction" : "Izlaidiet ievadu",
    "You are on the fediverse" : "Jūs atrodaties fediversā",
    "Your Nextcloud made you an account. This is your address — anyone on Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube or any other server that speaks ActivityPub can follow it:" : "Jūsu Nextcloud izveidoja jums kontu. Šī ir jūsu adrese — ikviens Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube vai jebkurā citā serverī, kas runā ActivityPub, var tai sekot:",
    "Copied" : "Kopēts",
    "Copy" : "Kopēt",
    "Give it to people the way you would an email address. Your profile, your avatar and your name come from your Nextcloud account and can be changed on your profile page." : "Dodiet to cilvēkiem tāpat kā e-pasta adresi. Jūsu profils, iemiesojums un jūsu vārds nāk no jūsu Nextcloud konta, un tos var mainīt jūsu profila lapā.",
    "A feed is only as good as who is in it" : "Barība ir tik laba, cik laba tajā ir",
    "Nothing shows up here until you follow somebody. Two places to start:" : "Šeit nekas neparādās, kamēr nesekojat kādam. Divas vietas, kur sākt:",
    "People on your Nextcloud" : "Cilvēki jūsu Nextcloud",
    "Looking around …" : "Paskatoties apkārt…",
    "Nobody on this Nextcloud has said where they are on the fediverse yet. You are the first — your handle is now on your Nextcloud profile, so the next person will see you here." : "Neviens šajā Nextcloud vēl nav teicis, kur viņi atrodas fediversā. Jūs esat pirmais — jūsu rokturis tagad ir jūsu Nextcloud profilā, tāpēc nākamā persona jūs redzēs šeit.",
    "Starter packs" : "Sākuma paketes",
    "No starter packs on this server. Discover has suggestions and what is trending." : "Šajā serverī nav sākuma pakotņu. Discover piedāvā ieteikumus un to, kas ir aktuāls.",
    "Already somewhere else?" : "Vai jau kaut kur citur?",
    "If you have an account on Mastodon or another server, bring the people you follow. Mastodon and servers like it export them as following_accounts.csv, Pixelfed as pixelfed-following.json — upload that file and each one is followed from here." : "Ja jums ir konts Mastodon vai citā serverī, ņemiet līdzi personas, kurām sekojat. Mastodon un līdzīgi serveri tos eksportē kā follow_accounts.csv, Pixelfed kā pixelfed-following.json — augšupielādējiet šo failu, un katrs no tiem tiek sekots no šejienes.",
    "Following …" : "Seko…",
    "Upload your follows" : "Augšupielādējiet savus sekotājus",
    "On Mastodon: Preferences → Import and export → Data export → Follows (CSV). Moving your followers over as well is in Settings, under Migration — that one is a one-way move, so it is not a button here." : "Mastodon: Preferences → Import and Export → Data export → Follows (CSV). Arī sekotāju pārvietošana notiek sadaļā Iestatījumi sadaļā Migrācija — šī kustība ir vienvirziena, tāpēc šeit tā nav poga.",
    "That is all there is to it" : "Tas ir viss",
    "Your feed fills up as the people you follow post. Meanwhile, say hello — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Jūsu plūsma aizpildās, kad personas, kurām sekojat, publicē. Tikmēr pasveiciniet — pirmais ieraksts ir tas, kā fedivers uzzina, ka esat šeit.",
    "You have not followed anyone yet, and that is fine: Discover is always a click away in the sidebar. Say hello in the meantime — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Jūs vēl nevienam neesat sekojis, un tas ir labi: Discover vienmēr ir viena klikšķa attālumā sānjoslā. Tikmēr pasveiciniet — pirmais ieraksts ir tas, kā fedivers uzzina, ka esat šeit.",
    "Back" : "Atpakaļ",
    "Next" : "Tālāk",
    "Write your first post" : "Uzraksti savu pirmo ziņu",
