    "Constellation" : "Zvaigznājs",
    "Nobody new came out of it. Many servers do not publish who an account follows, so this works better the more people you follow." : "Neviens jauns no tā neiznāca. Daudzi serveri nepublicē, kam seko konts, tāpēc tas darbojas labāk, jo vairāk cilvēku sekojat.",
    "_Follow one more account and this can look at who they follow._::_Follow {count} more accounts and this can look at who they follow._" : ["Sekojiet vēl vienam kontam, un tas var redzēt, kam viņi seko.", "Sekojiet {count} citiem kontiem, un tas var redzēt, kam tie seko.", "Sekojiet {count} citiem kontiem, un tas var redzēt, kam tie seko."],
