    "longest quiet spell" : "garākā klusuma burvestība",
    "Who you talk with" : "Ar ko tu runā",
    "From the replies rather than from who you follow. The two are rarely the same list." : "No atbildēm, nevis no tiem, kam sekojat. Abi reti ir viens un tas pats saraksts.",
    "not followed" : "nav sekots",
    "{n}% of the people who replied to you are people you do not follow." : "{n}% cilvēku, kas jums atbildēja, ir cilvēki, kuriem jūs nesekojat.",
